{"t":"read","text":"You can enjoy biryani today by keeping rice to one katori, packing in paneer for protein, and filling the rest with raita and salad."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Paneer vegetable biryani with raita","min":30,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"paneer and vegetable biryani made with light oil"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cucumber onion raita"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato salad"}],"why":"Paneer gives protein while raita and fresh salad keep the meal filling without overloading on rice.","skip":"deep-fried onions, extra ghee, and rich gravy"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Soya chunk vegetable pulao","min":25,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"soya chunk and vegetable pulao"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"plain curd"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"thin yellow moong dal"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"sliced cucumber and carrot salad"}],"why":"Soya chunks absorb the spices well and offer a lighter, high-protein alternative that cooks quickly."}

{"t":"read","text":"Enjoy the dinner with your friends by capping the pizza at two slices, adding eggs and salad to stay full."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Two slices pizza with boiled eggs","min":0,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"slice","f":"thin crust vegetable pizza"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"boiled eggs"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"cucumber and tomato salad"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"water with lemon"}],"why":"Two slices satisfy the craving while boiled eggs and salad bring protein and roughage to keep you full.","skip":"Garlic bread, cheese dips, and soft drinks.","later":"A light home-cooked breakfast like vegetable poha tomorrow."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Single slice with a large salad","min":0,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"slice","f":"thin crust vegetable pizza"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"boiled eggs"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"mixed vegetable salad"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"plain water"}],"why":"Having just one slice gives the pizza taste while eggs and raw vegetables handle the actual hunger cleanly.","skip":"Garlic bread, fried sides, and sweet drinks."}

{"t":"read","text":"You can enjoy the samosa by sticking to one piece, adding protein alongside, and keeping the chai small so your energy stays steady."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Single samosa with chana and chai","min":0,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"samosa"},{"q":1,"u":"fistful","f":"roasted chana"},{"q":2,"u":"tablespoon","f":"mint coriander chutney"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"cutting chai with less sugar"}],"why":"One samosa paired with dry roasted chana gives you the warmth and crunch you want without making you feel sluggish.","skip":"second samosa and sweet tamarind chutney","later":"Keep dinner light with phulka and moong dal"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Warm chana chaat and cutting chai","min":0,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"warm aloo chana chaat"},{"q":2,"u":"tablespoon","f":"mint coriander chutney"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"cutting chai with less sugar"}],"why":"Carries the same tangy street-food spices as a samosa filling while skipping the deep-fried outer crust entirely.","skip":"fried sev topping and sweet chutney","later":"Have a regular home dinner with vegetables and roti"}

{"t":"read","text":"Because of diabetes, fitting gulab jamun is something for your coach, so tonight we answer that warm craving safely with spices and dairy."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Roti dalma with cardamom chhena","min":30,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"dalma with mixed vegetables"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"potol torkari"},{"q":2,"u":"tablespoon","f":"fresh unsweetened chhena with crushed cardamom"}],"why":"Vegetables and dal bring steady fibre, while warm cardamom chhena gives a comforting finish without spiking sugar."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Phulka with chana dal and spiced milk","min":25,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"chana dal with coconut"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"bhindi bhaja"},{"q":0.5,"u":"glass","f":"warm milk with nutmeg and cinnamon"}],"why":"Hearty dal paired with warming cinnamon in milk calms evening sweet cravings while holding your sugar steady."}

{"t":"read","text":"Lunch was heavy and deep-fried, so dinner balances the day with lean protein, plenty of vegetables, and minimal grain."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Boiled egg curry with greens","min":25,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"piece","f":"hard-boiled eggs in light tomato-onion gravy"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"palak sabzi cooked with little oil"},{"q":1,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"sliced cucumber and radish"}],"why":"Light egg protein and fibre-rich greens digest easily after the heavy bhature, keeping grain low for weight loss.","skip":"second phulka, rice, and butter"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Tawa chicken with stir-fry vegetables","min":20,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"palm-size tawa chicken cooked in one teaspoon oil"},{"q":2,"u":"katori","f":"stir-fried capsicum, beans, and carrots"},{"q":1,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"}],"why":"Lean chicken satisfies dinner hunger while two cups of vegetables fill the plate without extra starch.","skip":"cream, rich gravies, and naan"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Light yellow moong dal with salad","min":20,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"thin yellow moong dal with jeera tadka"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"lauki sabzi"},{"q":1,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato"}],"why":"A gentle, warm home plate that rests digestion and stays very light on calories.","skip":"ghee on the phulka and fried sides"}

{"t":"read","text":"Skipping breakfast makes you want a heavy meal, but a normal grain portion with extra dal and vegetables will settle hunger best."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Rice with thick sambar and poriyal","min":25,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed rice"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"thick vegetable sambar"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"beans poriyal"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"plain curd"}],"why":"Keep the rice to one katori and let the lentil sambar and poriyal handle the sharp hunger comfortably.","skip":"Papad, pickle, and second helpings of rice.","later":"Plan a small bowl of roasted chana or sundal around four today."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Phulka with vegetable dal kootu","min":20,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"vegetable dal kootu"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cucumber kosambari salad"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"plain buttermilk"}],"why":"Phulkas with protein-rich dal kootu fill you well without the sleepiness that follows a large rice meal."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Curd rice with moong sundal","min":15,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"curd rice with light tempering"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"warm sprouted moong sundal"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cabbage and peas poriyal"}],"why":"A quick, gentle option where sprouted moong covers the protein you missed earlier in the day."}

{"t":"read","text":"Wedding buffets always have good tandoori options, so fill up on roasted protein and fresh salad first before touching the heavier gravies."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Tandoori chicken with salad and roti","min":0,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"piece","f":"tandoori chicken"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"cucumber, onion and tomato salad"},{"q":1,"u":"","f":"plain tandoori roti without butter"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"yellow dal"}],"why":"Tandoori items give you clean protein without rich gravies, while raw salad fills half the plate naturally.","skip":"Fried starters, creamy butter gravies, and sugary drinks"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Chicken tikka with dal and rice","min":0,"items":[{"q":3,"u":"piece","f":"chicken tikka"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"green salad with lemon"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"plain steamed rice"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"dal tadka"}],"why":"Dry tikka with plain dal and rice keeps dinner satisfying without the heavy cream found in buffet curries.","skip":"Naan brushed with butter and fried appetizers"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Paneer tikka with dry sabzi","min":0,"items":[{"q":3,"u":"piece","f":"paneer tikka"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"salad with lemon"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"dry mixed vegetable sabzi"},{"q":1,"u":"","f":"phulka or plain tandoori roti"}],"why":"Roasted paneer and dry vegetables offer a balanced plate if you prefer to skip the meat counter tonight.","skip":"Malai kofta, paneer makhani, and gulab jamun"}

{"t":"read","text":"Since your profile is vegetarian, we will skip the eggs and use bread, onion, and milk with pantry staples for a balanced late breakfast."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Vaghareli bread with warm milk","min":15,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"slice","f":"bread cut into cubes"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"onion and tomato spiced masala"},{"q":1,"u":"teaspoon","f":"oil for tempering"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"warm milk"}],"why":"Tossing bread with onion and spices makes quick vaghareli bread, paired with milk for protein after a delayed start.","skip":"eggs to honour your vegetarian preference","later":"plan a dal and vegetable meal for your next eating time"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Toasted bread with onion kachumber","min":10,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"slice","f":"toasted bread"},{"q":1,"u":"teaspoon","f":"oil"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"chopped onion and tomato kachumber"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"warm turmeric milk"}],"why":"Crisp toast paired with fresh onion relish and warm milk keeps this late breakfast simple, steady, and nourishing.","skip":"eggs to keep the plate vegetarian","later":"have a cooked lentil meal for dinner"}

{"t":"read","text":"Pav bhaji fits dinner well when made Jain-style with raw banana and vegetables, keeping pav to two pieces and adding paneer for protein."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Jain pav bhaji with paneer","min":30,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"Jain bhaji with raw banana, peas and tomato"},{"q":2,"u":"piece","f":"pav lightly toasted with 1 teaspoon butter"},{"q":0.5,"u":"katori","f":"tawa paneer cubes"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced cucumber with lemon"}],"why":"Raw banana and peas create the classic mash without root vegetables, while paneer balances the bread with solid protein.","skip":"extra butter floating on the bhaji"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Tawa paneer with spiced bhaji phulka","min":25,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"bhaji spiced paneer and capsicum bhurji"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed peas and sweet corn chaat"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"chaas with roasted jeera"}],"why":"Captures the pav bhaji spice blend in a lighter, protein-rich paneer scramble paired with plain phulka."}

{"t":"read","text":"Since you eat vegan, we can recreate that rich makhani gravy using firm tofu and soaked cashews to give you protein for strength."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Tofu Makhani Plate","min":25,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"tofu makhani in cashew tomato gravy"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cucumber and tomato salad"}],"why":"Firm tofu supplies solid protein for strength, while cashew paste creates the butter masala texture entirely dairy-free.","skip":"Dairy butter and heavy cream","later":"Plan a simple dal and roasted vegetables for dinner"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Matar Tofu Curry Plate","min":20,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"matar tofu in light onion tomato gravy"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cabbage and carrot kachumber"}],"why":"A simpler homestyle gravy keeps the meal lighter while tofu and green peas support your strength goals.","skip":"Heavy nut pastes and excess oil","later":"Have roasted chana if hunger hits by evening"}

{"t":"read","text":"Rajma rice works well for lunch, but we will trade the raita for a crisp lemon kachumber to keep it completely dairy-free."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Rajma chawal with fresh kachumber salad","min":30,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"thick rajma curry"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed white rice"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"cucumber onion tomato kachumber with lemon"}],"why":"Delivers your comfort lunch without dairy, balancing the beans and rice with a juicy, crunchy salad.","skip":"curd raita to keep it dairy-free"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Rajma with phulka and sliced cucumber","min":25,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"thick rajma curry"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"plate","f":"sliced cucumber and carrots with lemon"}],"why":"Swapping rice for phulka gives a lighter feel while keeping the warm rajma at the centre.","skip":"rice and dairy raita"}

{"t":"read","text":"Here are three wheat-free, easy-to-digest dinners that keep the meal light without skipping on protein or vegetables."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Vegetable moong khichdi with curd","min":25,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"vegetable moong dal khichdi"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"plain curd"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cucumber and tomato salad with lemon"}],"why":"Gentle on the stomach for night, gives balanced protein and fibre, and keeps cooking to a single pot.","skip":"extra ghee on top"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Paneer stuffed moong chilla with salad","min":20,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"piece","f":"thin moong dal chilla"},{"q":0.5,"u":"katori","f":"crumbled paneer filling"},{"q":2,"u":"tablespoon","f":"mint coriander chutney"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced carrot and cucumber"}],"why":"Skips grains entirely for a light dinner while moong and paneer provide steady protein.","skip":"excess oil on the tawa"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Steamed rice with dal and palak","min":25,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed white rice"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"yellow moong dal"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"mildly spiced palak sabzi"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced cucumber"}],"why":"A classic light dinner holding rice to one katori, backed by spinach fibre and comforting moong dal.","skip":"second helping of rice"}

{"t":"read","text":"It is late and you are hungry, so we are keeping cooking under fifteen minutes with eggs or paneer and light grain."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Quick egg bhurji and phulka","min":15,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"eggs scrambled with onion and tomato"},{"q":1,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato"}],"why":"Eggs cook in minutes to fill you up safely late at night without sitting heavy.","skip":"extra roti or buttery paratha","later":"Drink a glass of water before heading to bed."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Paneer bhurji with soft phulka","min":15,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"paneer bhurji with minimal oil"},{"q":1,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"sliced cucumber"}],"why":"Fresh paneer cooks fast, provides solid protein, and pairs with raw cucumber to curb hunger.","skip":"heavy tadka or butter"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Moong dal khichdi with curd","min":20,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"moong dal khichdi"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"plain fresh curd"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato"}],"why":"A warm one-pot meal that settles easily before bed while keeping your grain portion controlled.","skip":"papad or fried sides"}

{"t":"read","text":"Post-workout recovery needs a direct protein source and simple hydration to help rebuild muscle without sitting heavy."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Boiled eggs with chana sundal","min":15,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"boiled eggs with pepper"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"tempered chana sundal"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"thin buttermilk with curry leaves"}],"why":"Eggs give immediate protein for muscle repair, while chana and buttermilk replenish spent energy and minerals."}
{"t":"plate","name":"South Indian egg podimas with fruit","min":10,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"eggs scrambled with onion and curry leaves"},{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"small banana"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"tender coconut water"}],"why":"Quick protein from scrambled eggs paired with simple carbohydrates and fluids speeds up post-exercise recovery."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Sprouted moong sundal and eggs","min":10,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed green gram sundal"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"boiled eggs sliced with cumin powder"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"ginger buttermilk"}],"why":"Combines pulse and egg protein to support strength building while staying gentle on the stomach."}

{"t":"read","text":"For steady energy and iron, pair iron-dense legumes or greens with a fresh squeeze of lemon."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Kala Chana and Phulka","min":30,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"kala chana curry"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato salad"},{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"lemon wedge squeezed over chana"}],"why":"Kala chana provides plant iron, and the fresh lemon juice helps your body take it in better."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Palak Dal and Rice","min":25,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"spinach moong dal"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed rice"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"carrot and cucumber kachumber"},{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"lemon wedge squeezed over dal"}],"why":"Greens simmered into dal give iron and fibre, balanced neatly with rice and vitamin C from lemon."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Rajma and Phulka Plate","min":35,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"rajma masala"},{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"onion tomato salad with lemon dressing"}],"why":"Rajma brings steady protein and iron, kept light with home-style phulka and a sharp lemon salad."}

{"t":"read","text":"It is past noon, so we will keep this simple to cook, balanced for steady energy, and rich in dairy for your B12."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Paneer bhurji with warm phulkas","min":20,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka with light ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"paneer bhurji with onion and tomato"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"fresh set curd"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato"}],"why":"Paneer and curd supply easy protein and natural dairy B12 without feeling heavy on a late morning.","later":"Plan a lighter dal and sabzi lunch or early dinner."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Stuffed moong chilla with chaas","min":20,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"moong dal chilla"},{"q":0.5,"u":"katori","f":"crumbled paneer filling"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"salted chaas with roasted jeera"},{"q":2,"u":"tablespoon","f":"mint coriander chutney"}],"why":"Light on the stomach, quick to prepare, and packs both lentils and dairy into your late start.","later":"Have a fruit or handful of nuts if dinner is delayed."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Curd and vegetable dalia bowl","min":25,"items":[{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"vegetable dalia"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"thick curd"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"kachumber salad with lemon juice"}],"why":"A comforting one-pot meal that gives you steady grains along with cooling curd for your B12 needs."}

{"t":"read","text":"Maach bhaat fits your strength goal well if fish leads the plate alongside a measured portion of rice and greens."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Traditional machher jhol with steamed rice","min":30,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"piece","f":"palm-size rohu or katla in light curry"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"steamed rice"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"stir-fried spinach or seasonal greens"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato"}],"why":"Two pieces of fresh fish give the protein you need for strength, while light gravy keeps lunch easy on your stomach.","skip":"deep-fried fish pieces and heavy oily gravy"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Steamed fish with dal and rice","min":25,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"piece","f":"steamed fish fillet or bhetki paturi"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed rice"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"thin moong dal"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cucumber salad with lemon"}],"why":"Steaming keeps the fish tender and light while pairing it with dal gives a solid double dose of clean protein."}

{"t":"read","text":"Packing a tiffin for weight loss works best with a protein-rich dal or kootu, high-fibre poriyal, and a measured portion of grain."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Rice with thick sambar and poriyal","min":25,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed rice"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"thick vegetable sambar"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"beans poriyal with minimal coconut"},{"q":0.5,"u":"katori","f":"plain set curd"}],"why":"The high portion of sambar and poriyal manages hunger well through the afternoon without extra grain.","skip":"appalam or pickle"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Phulka with moong kootu and sundal","min":25,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"chow-chow and moong dal kootu"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"boiled chana sundal"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"cucumber slices"}],"why":"Sundal brings solid protein while the vegetable kootu travels neatly in a tiffin box."}

{"t":"read","text":"A light snack with steady protein and fresh crunch will settle your hunger without making you sluggish this afternoon."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Moong sprouts and cucumber chaat","min":10,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed moong sprouts"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"chopped cucumber and tomato with lemon"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"plain chaas with roasted jeera"}],"why":"Sprouts give gentle protein while cucumber and chaas keep the snack light and easy to digest.","skip":"Sev, fried mixture, and sweet tamarind chutney.","later":"Plan a balanced dinner with two phulkas, dal, and vegetables."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Single vegetable besan chilla","min":15,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"thin besan chilla made with minimal oil"},{"q":2,"u":"tablespoon","f":"fresh mint coriander chutney"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced carrot and cucumber"}],"why":"Besan fills you comfortably without heaviness, paired with raw vegetables for fresh fibre.","skip":"Extra oil or butter on the tawa."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Roasted makhana and paneer crunch","min":10,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"dry roasted makhana with jeera powder"},{"q":4,"u":"piece","f":"lightly pan-tossed paneer cubes"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"sliced cucumber with lemon"}],"why":"Fresh paneer provides clean protein while makhana satisfies the need for something crisp and light.","skip":"Packaged salted namkeen or extra butter."}

{"t":"read","text":"I work with kitchen portions rather than counts, so here are balanced North Indian lunch plates built with simple household measures."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Phulka with Dal and Bhindi","min":25,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"yellow moong dal"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"bhindi sabzi"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"sliced cucumber and tomato salad"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"plain curd"}],"why":"Salad and vegetables take up half the plate to keep you satisfied while the grain portion stays measured.","skip":"pickles and extra ghee"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Paneer Bhurji with Phulka and Lauki","min":20,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"phulka without ghee"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"paneer bhurji with onion and tomato"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"lauki sabzi"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"kachumber salad with lemon juice"}],"why":"Paneer gives clear protein alongside mild lauki and crunchy salad for steady fullness.","skip":"fried papad"}
{"t":"plate","name":"Rajma Chawal with Kachumber Salad","min":20,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"steamed rice"},{"q":1.5,"u":"katori","f":"rajma curry"},{"q":1,"u":"bowl","f":"kachumber salad"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"plain curd"}],"why":"Keeping the rice to one katori lets the rajma and vegetables carry the meal comfortably.","skip":"a second helping of rice"}
